::  mar/register/intent: one pilgrim in spirit, at /intents/<id>.
::
::    Stored as [%1 intent] (see +stored-intent in lib/register). A noun
::    passthrough like the registration's: the shape ladder lives in
::    +read-intent, so a later shape never booms a stored grub.
::
|_  n=*
++  grad  %noun
++  grow
  |%
  ++  noun  n
  --
++  grab
  |%
  ++  noun  *
  --
--
